\subsection{Executing an RQ workflow}

Without [[--limit]], or with [[--limit 0]], [[rq]] searches without a
limit, as [[search]] does (\cref{sec:no-limit-default}): it passes a very
large limit to provider implementations.
This avoids changing provider signatures while still enabling a fully paged
search.  A search without [[--limit]] prints the same notice of a large
total as [[search]] does, from the same listener.

