The moves themselves are tested on an export of three files,
[[rep.bib]], [[rep.csv]] and [[rep.tex]] (moved in that order), over an
earlier export of a session that has since gained a paper, so that every
new file differs from the old one.  The case of
\url{https://github.com/dbosk/scholar/issues/320} is a directory at the
second target: the export must stop before moving [[rep.bib]] and say
that nothing was written.  A failure the check cannot see, and a failure
to put a file back, are injected through [[os.replace]], as in
\cref{sec:staged-outputs}: a staged file's move has its source in the
staging directory, a restore in the directory of replaced files.

