sample needs it (\cref{sec:tui-blind-review} in the TUI module, which
also says why the TUI asks for the name when it is not given here).
[[--blind]] starts the TUI in blind review, the only way to record a
screening as blind there, since only then has no verdict of the sample
been on the screen before.  A
name given empty is refused before the session is opened (status~2),
since it would record nobody under a name.

