The loop over the agent's fields names its variable [[audit_field]],
not [[name]]: this chunk is tangled into [[sessions_decide]], whose
[[name]] is the session argument, and Python has no block scope, so a
loop variable called [[name]] would overwrite the argument for the rest
of the function.  The final message would then read \enquote{marked
kept in session 'agent\_decided\_at'}, the last field the loop
visited (\#280).  The save is not affected, since it goes through
[[save_session(session)]], not through the name.

